# Bonds of Mythril (crystalWar 59) completed beside Bastok mission 3-1 The Four Musketeers at Naji (Task 5 review
# Important 1): a level 99 Warrior in the Metalworks with Bonds of Mythril completed and 3-1 current (GMs; the other
# missions as the main flow). 3-1's Metalworks section (currentMission only, no nation test) answers Naji with
# mission:event(717) at mission status 1 or more: an Event, over Bonds' 971 (replaceDefault). Mission status 0 (a GM):
# 3-1 has no reply there: 971.
lists Metalworks/Naji/onTrigger
char zone=Metalworks pos=68.365,-13.999,-4.562 job=WAR lvl=99
quest CrystalWar.TheTruthLiesHid completed
quest CrystalWar.BondsOfMythril completed
mission Bastok TheFourMusketeers current
mission Wotg AdieuLilisette current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
missionstatus Bastok 1                  # a GM: 3-1 at status 1
trigger Naji                            # 3-1's 717 (an Event) over Bonds' 971 (replaceDefault)
finish
missionstatus Bastok 0                  # a GM
trigger Naji                            # status 0: 3-1 has no reply: 971
finish
